Ezr 8:1 , The companions of Ezra, who returned from Babylon;
Ezr 8:15 , He sends to Iddo for ministers for the temple;
Ezr 8:21 , He keeps a fast;
Ezr 8:24 , He commits the treasures to the custody of the priests;
Ezr 8:31 , From Ahava they come to Jerusalem;
Ezr 8:33 , The treasure is weighed in the temple;
Ezr 8:36 , The commission is delivered.
